Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;">)</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 15pt;"><td valign="bottom" width="680" nowrap="" style="border: rgb(236, 233, 216); padding: 0in 5.4pt; width: 510pt; height: 15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><u>SEA Users</u>&nbsp;-&nbsp;&nbsp;MO-SEA SF Request (</font><a aria-label="Link SEASFrequest@monster.com.sg" id="menurgh" href="mailto:SEASFrequest@monster.com.sg" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="mailto:seasfrequest@monster.com.sg" style="font-size: 12pt;">SEASFrequest@monster.com.sg</a><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;">)</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</font></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><u></u>Subject: Promote Pending Lead<strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;</strong></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Account.Name}</b></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></strong></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To ensure that your request is processed correctly, please&nbsp;<u>DO NOT</u>&nbsp;change the subject line of this message<br><br>Please do not delete any fields when filling out template.</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please enter the following, all the fields are mandatory to process this request:</span></font><br><font face="arial" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Pending Lead Name - </span></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Account.Name}</font><br><font face="arial" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Pending Lead Sales Channel&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span></font><font face="arial">{!Account.SalesChannel__c}</font><br><font face="arial" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Pending Lead Sales Rep -&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Account.Primary_Sales_Rep__c}</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Pending Lead Sales Rep Job Type -&nbsp;</span>{!User.Job_Type__c}</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Pending Lead Sales Rep Supporting Country -&nbsp;</span>{!User.Location__c}</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Reason for&nbsp;Urgent Promotion Request:&nbsp;</font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
